@startuml 系统组件图
title 系统组件图（结构性图）

package "表现层" {
  component [登录界面] as UI_Login
  component [账本主页\n（统计/红绿灯）] as UI_Home
  component [记录列表与查询] as UI_Query
  component [创建账本页] as UI_NewLedger
  component [审核页] as UI_Audit
  component [成员管理页] as UI_Member
  component [结算页] as UI_Settle
  component [日志查看页] as UI_Log
}

package "业务逻辑层" {
  component [用户与权限模块] as SVC_Auth
  component [账本与模板模块] as SVC_Ledger
  component [成员管理模块] as SVC_Member
  component [收支记录模块] as SVC_Record
  component [审核模块\n（竞争加锁）] as SVC_Audit
  component [查询统计模块] as SVC_Stats
  component [结算模块] as SVC_Settle
  component [预算报警模块] as SVC_Budget
  component [日志模块] as SVC_Log
}

package "数据访问层" {
  component [数据访问组件\n（各模块 DAO）] as DAO
  database "MySQL 数据库" as MySQL
}

interface "IAudit 审核接口" as IAudit
interface "IStats 统计接口" as IStats

' 表现层 → 业务层
UI_Login ..> SVC_Auth
UI_NewLedger ..> SVC_Ledger
UI_Home ..> SVC_Record
UI_Audit ..> SVC_Audit
UI_Member ..> SVC_Member
UI_Settle ..> SVC_Settle
UI_Log ..> SVC_Log
UI_Query ..> SVC_Stats
UI_Home ..> SVC_Stats
UI_Home ..> SVC_Budget

' 业务层模块间接口（提供/使用）
SVC_Audit --( IAudit
SVC_Record ..> IAudit
SVC_Stats --( IStats
SVC_Record ..> IStats
SVC_Settle ..> IStats

' 业务层 → 数据访问层
SVC_Auth ..> DAO
SVC_Ledger ..> DAO
SVC_Member ..> DAO
SVC_Record ..> DAO
SVC_Audit ..> DAO
SVC_Stats ..> DAO
SVC_Settle ..> DAO
SVC_Budget ..> DAO
SVC_Log ..> DAO

DAO ..> MySQL

note bottom of DAO
  依赖方向一律自上而下（单向）：
  表现层 → 业务层 → 数据层，
  数据层不反向依赖上层
end note

@enduml
